    "body": "## Summary\n\n- The module no longer uses `mini-frame`, so `sp-mini-frame` becomes `sp-posframe`: file `libraries/modules/ui/sp-posframe.el`, feature, doc `docs/tangles/ui/sp-posframe.org`, `init.el`, `docs/main.org`, the load-order diagram and the guides that mention it.\n- The doc has a section \"Why a posframe, and why the name changed\": a comparison of `mini-frame` and `vertico-posframe` for this setup, and an honest statement that the move was a precaution. The hang tests ran before the fixes were pulled, so they do not show that `mini-frame` hangs with the setup of #134. The section gives the test that decides it (the state at commit `93c5539`).\n- The CHANGELOG entry of #136 is corrected the same way.\n\n## Not tested\n\n- Not run in Emacs (none in the container). Only the rename and tangle path are checked by reading.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01MfEFZ7KDkwwcifErLfjf4X",
